&lt;h2 style="color:#00FF88; text-align:center;">📢 ABISO SA MGA NAG-AABANG&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align:center; color:#888888; font-size:13px;">Proyekto: Kasalukuyang Ginagawa — Updated: 2026-09-19&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3 style="color:#40E0D0; margin-top:20px;">📊 KASALUKUYANG ANTAS NG PROYEKTO — ~30% TAPOS&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p style="color:#4CAF50; font-weight:bold;">✅ TAPOS NA — ANG BALANGKAS AT PUNDASYON:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:5px 0 15px 20px; padding:0;">
&lt;li>Buong sistema ng menu — Side Menu, Main Screen, Mixer, Help, Settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Custom na disenyo ng pihitan — neon glow, indikasyon, auto-save&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Vocal Channel — Gain at Sensitivity — gumagana nang maayos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Sistema ng pag-update — awtomatikong tinitingnan ang bagong bersyon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Gabay ng paggamit — buong dokumentasyon nakahanda na&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p style="color:#FFC107; font-weight:bold;">⏳ KASALUKUYANG GINAGAWA — ANG DETALYADONG MIXER:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:5px 0 15px 20px; padding:0;">
&lt;li>Lahat ng pihitan sa Vocal Channel — Reverb, Delay, EQ, Compressor, Noise Gate, Master — 12+ na pihitan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Guitar Effects Channel — Distortion, Overdrive, Wah-Wah, Chorus, at iba pa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p style="color:#F44336; font-weight:bold;">🔴 HINDI PA NASISIMULA — ANG PUSO NG PROYEKTO:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:5px 0 15px 20px; padding:0;">
&lt;li>Preset System — pag-save at pagbukas ng sariling mga setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Pedal Interface — 3-pihit na kontrol sa pangunahing screen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>AUDIO ENGINE — C++ na pagpoproseso ng tunog na may mababang antala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 style="color:#40E0D0; margin-top:20px;">🎨 INAASAHANG PAGBABAGO SA DISENYO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:5px 0 15px 20px; padding:0;">
&lt;li>&lt;b>Pangunahing Screen → Pedal Board&lt;/b> — parang totoong sahig na may mga pedal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>&lt;b>Mixer Screen — TAB Switch&lt;/b> — 🎤 Vocal ↔ 🎸 Guitar, VU Meter, kulay bawat kategorya&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>&lt;b>Preset Screen — Preview&lt;/b> — makikita mo ang itsura bago piliin, Export/Import&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 style="color:#40E0D0; margin-top:20px;">🧭 MGA BAGONG KAKAYAHAN&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:5px 0 15px 20px; padding:0;">
&lt;li>Bottom Navigation Bar — 🏠 Home 🎚️ Mixer 📋 Presets ⚙️ Settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Real-time na pagbabago — naririnig AGAD habang pinipihit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Auto-save, Favorites, Backup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>Bluetooth Audio, Share Preset, Dark Mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 style="color:#FFD700; margin-top:20px;">🎯 ANG LAYUNIN NATIN&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style="margin:5px 0 15px 20px; padding:0;">
&lt;li>&lt;b>TOTOONG MABILIS&lt;/b> — &lt;10ms na antala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>&lt;b>DIREKTANG DALOY NG TUNOG&lt;/b> — mikropono → pandinig&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>&lt;b>PARA SA LAHAT&lt;/b> — boses man o gitara&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li>&lt;b>WALANG BAYAD&lt;/b> — para sa lahat na mahal ang musika&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center; color:#888888; margin-top:30px; font-style:italic;">🙏 MARAMING SALAMAT SA PAGTITIIS&lt;br>
"Ang musika — para sa lahat, kahit saan."&lt;/p&gt;
